        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function is responsible for deleting a <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_vertex" kindref="compound">Vertex</ref> Array Object (VAO) from GPU memory. The VAO was created during initialization and holds references to other data such as buffers, attributes etc. that are used in rendering operations. After deletion, this VAO can no longer be used by the OpenGL context.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>void </para>
