        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function returns an iterator that points to the first element in the vector of <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_vertex_buffer" kindref="compound">VertexBuffer</ref> objects, which represents the start of the vertex buffers collection. The returned iterator can be used with standard container functions like std::advance or std::next to move through the collection.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>A constant iterator pointing to the beginning of the vertex buffer list. If no elements exist in the vector, the returned iterator will equal <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_open_g_l_vertex_array_1a86e2e9353881fc26aa13f186d973faa8" kindref="member">end()</ref>.</para>
</simplesect>
